# The testers who may open the closed alpha, imported by the Caddyfile's `basic_auth`.
# Copy this file to `tester-credentials.caddy` beside it (ignored by git) and add one line per
# tester: `<username> <argon2id hash>`. docs/staging.md says how to make a hash.
# Removing a line and restarting Caddy revokes that tester.
